style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><s=
pan>Nationwide student protests have become the most vivid manifestation of=
 this crisis. Last week, </span><a href=3D"https://nl.nytimes.com/f/newslet=
